OL,3,ARussell Brand told police he never had
OL,4,Anon-consensual sex, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning - this report contains graphic
OL,7,Fcontent
OL,9,FRussell Brand told police in interviews
OL,10,Fin response to allegations of rape and
OL,11,Fsexual assault that he had never
OL,12,Fengaged in "non-consensual sexual
OL,13,Factivity", a court has heard.
OL,15,FBrand, 51, was interviewed four times
OL,16,Fbetween 2023 and 2025 by officers.
OL,18,FThe TV and media personality is
OL,19,Fcurrently on trial at Southwark Crown
OL,20,FCourt in London on three counts of rape
OL,21,Fand other offences. He denies all the
OL,22,Fcharges.
